    "trigger": {
      "slot": "trigger",
      "claims": [
        {
          "content": "The C² JU assumes R² of an IU when one of the following occurs: a J2 PPLI message is not received for 40 to 60 seconds; a J2 PPLI message other than J2.0 is received with the NPS Indicator set to Inactive or Conditional Radio Silence; a J7.0 (ACT = 0) Drop Track message is received from the FJU for a PU, RU, or other IU; or the Geodetic Position Quality in the J2 PPLI message is set to value 0.",
